  "solution": "Let's apply the options into the given equation by using the BODMAS rule :\n\nBODMAS rule is Bracket of Division Multiplication Addition Subtraction.\n\n67 * 88 * 8 * 14 * 3 * 19 * 17\n\nApplying option 1) -, ×, =, −, ÷, +\n\n67 - 88 × 8 = 14 - 3 ÷ 19 + 17\n\n67 - 88 × 8 = 14 - 0.15 + 17\n\n67 - 704 = 14 - 0.15 + 17\n\n67 - 704 = 31 - 0.15 \n\n-637 = 30.85 Incorrect\n\nApplying option 2)+, ÷, -, ×, -, =\n\n67 + 88 ÷ 8 - 14 × 3 - 19 = 17\n\n67 + 11 - 14 × 3 - 19 = 17\n\n67 + 11 - 42 - 19 = 17\n\n78 - 42 - 19 = 17 \n\n78 - 61 = 17\n\n17 = 17 **C**orrect\n\nApplying option 3) -, ÷, ×, +, =, -\n\n67 - 88 ÷ 8 × 14 + 3 = 19 - 17\n\n67 - 11 × 14 + 3 = 19 - 17\n\n67 - 154 + 3 = 19 - 17 \n\n70 - 154 = 19 - 17 \n\n-84 = 2 Incorrect\n\nApplying option 4) +, -, =, ×, -, ×\n\n67 + 88 - 8 = 14 × 3 - 19 × 17\n\n67 + 88 - 8 = 42 - 323\n\n155 - 8 = 42 - 323\n\n147 = -281 Incorrect\n\n Hence, the correct answer is **\"****+, ÷, -, ×, -, =\"**",
